        "text": "41. <code>(1/2 + 1/3) : (5/6) + 2^7 = x</code>\nişleminin sonucu kaçtır?",
        "options": [
          "A) 129",
          "B) 130",
          "C) 128",
          "D) 65",
          "E) 131"
        ],
        "correct": 0,
        "solution": "(1/2 + 1/3) = 5/6. (5/6) : (5/6) = 1. Sonuç = 1 + 2^7 = 129."
      },
      {
        "id": "e1_q42",
        "subject": "Matematik",
        "number": 42,
        "text": "42. <code>(1/2 + 1/3) : (5/6) + 2^8 = x</code>\nişleminin sonucu kaçtır?",
